1
00:00:03,43 --> 00:00:05,23
Are you looking at naked tribeswomen?
你在看原住民裸女嗎？

2
00:00:05,80 --> 00:00:07,13
No,look.
不是，你看

3
00:00:08,44 --> 00:00:09,99
That's a pig.
這是豬耶

4
00:00:10,47 --> 00:00:13,13
I know. But look at the knobs on it!
我知道，你看它的咪咪多大

5
00:00:17,41 --> 00:00:18,90
嘿

6
00:00:18,98 --> 00:00:20,97
Emily's cousin kicked me out.
艾蜜莉的表妹 竟然把我趕出來

7
00:00:21,25 --> 00:00:22,34
-What? -Why?
什麼？ 為什麼？

8
00:00:22,58 --> 00:00:25,28
When you sublet from your wife's cousin...
跟老婆的表妹分租公寓 

9
00:00:25,49 --> 00:00:29,62
...then you divorce,sometimes the cousin wants his apartment back.
要是之後又離婚 表妹就會突然把房子要回去

11
00:00:29,82 --> 00:00:31,35
Didn't you sign a lease?
怎麼可以？你們沒簽約嗎？

12
00:00:31,59 --> 00:00:33,99
Who needs a lease when it's "family"?
誰跟親戚租公寓還簽約？

13
00:00:36,36 --> 00:00:38,36
You can stay with us.
你可以跟我們住

14
00:00:39,13 --> 00:00:40,12
Anything you need.
包在我們身上

15
00:00:40,34 --> 00:00:43,17
But you have to let us know when you feel better...
你心情好一點就說一聲

17
00:00:43,44 --> 00:00:45,20
...so we can make fun of your hair.
好讓我們取笑你的雞窩頭

19
00:00:47,71 --> 00:00:49,04
You got it.
沒問題

20
00:00:49,44 --> 00:00:54,01
Thanks,I really appreciate this. I'm going to get packing again.
謝謝你們，我太感激了
我得回去打包行李了

22
00:00:54,28 --> 00:00:57,77
I've been moving around so much that I feel like a nomad.
我最近不斷搬家 簡直像是遊民

23
00:01:00,82 --> 00:01:04,05
-What? -He thought you said gonad.
怎麼了？他以為你說的是「咪咪」

25
00:01:06,19 --> 00:01:07,86
The One Where Ross Moves ln
本集播出：「自找苦吃」

00:01:08,860 --> 00:01:09,620
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

26
00:01:54,01 --> 00:01:57,74
If every place were this clean, it'd be tough making a living.
要是每家餐廳都跟你的一樣乾淨
我就沒飯吃了

28
00:01:58,45 --> 00:01:59,78
Oh,Larry!
別說了，賴瑞

29
00:02:00,42 --> 00:02:02,94
Do health inspectors work on commission?
衛生稽查員收佣金嗎？

30
00:02:03,18 --> 00:02:04,55
No,bribes.
不，不過收紅包

31
00:02:05,39 --> 00:02:07,85
-It's okay to laugh? -I was just kidding.
我可以笑吧？當然，我開玩笑啦

33
00:02:09,02 --> 00:02:12,12
-I'll check the kitchen floor. -Knock yourself out.
我去檢查廚房地板 請自便，賴瑞

35
00:02:13,43 --> 00:02:16,56
I don't get violations. You could eat beans off that floor.
我絕對不會違規
地板乾淨到 豆子都能撿起來吃

37
00:02:16,73 --> 00:02:19,96
But don't,because that'd be a violation.
別吃喔，否則你就違規了

38
00:02:20,97 --> 00:02:22,53
Yummy!
真可口

39
00:02:24,94 --> 00:02:27,60
Yeah,I'd let him check out my kitchen floor.
你說賴瑞？我也願意讓他檢查我廚房地板

41
00:02:31,55 --> 00:02:32,74
A ninety-eight.
98分

42
00:02:33,55 --> 00:02:36,21
I deducted two points for not wearing your hat.
你沒戴帽子所以扣兩分 

43
00:02:36,42 --> 00:02:38,58
That is a Section 5 violation.
因為違反第五條規定

44
00:02:38,79 --> 00:02:40,95
Now look,Larry,honey.
賴瑞，親愛的

45
00:02:41,92 --> 00:02:43,82
I wrote the book on Section 5.
第五條條文我是專家 

46
00:02:44,06 --> 00:02:46,55
You only need to wear it in the kitchen.
在廚房才要戴帽子

47
00:02:46,76 --> 00:02:49,49
-Where's your hat? -ln the kitchen. I'll get it.
你的帽子呢？
在廚房，我進去拿

49
00:02:51,50 --> 00:02:53,26
There's the two points!
扣兩分

50
00:02:54,07 --> 00:02:56,80
You should really read that book you wrote.
專家也不過如此嘛

51
00:03:04,25 --> 00:03:09,15
You saw the hat in the kitchen and knew she'd go in hatless to get it.
你看到帽子在廚房
知道她進去時沒戴帽子

53
00:03:09,35 --> 00:03:12,75
You could have your own health inspector detective show.
你可以當衛生稽查員 兼偵探了

54
00:03:14,09 --> 00:03:15,32
I don't know about that.
你太客氣了

55
00:03:15,52 --> 00:03:18,08
But then I could be your sidekick,Voonda.
我可以演你的助手薇達

56
00:03:19,09 --> 00:03:22,29
Maybe I could ask Voonda to dinner sometime?
薇達可以留電話給我 我就能約她出去吃飯

57
00:03:22,63 --> 00:03:24,33
She would love that...
她一定很開心

58
00:03:25,00 --> 00:03:28,13
...since you know all the clean places to eat.
因為你知道哪家餐廳才衛生

59
00:03:29,87 --> 00:03:31,63
I'll call you.
我再打給你 好

60
00:03:36,95 --> 00:03:38,94
He's so funny!
他真幽默

61
00:03:41,78 --> 00:03:44,05
「中央咖啡館」

62
00:03:45,69 --> 00:03:47,18
Thank you.
謝了 謝謝

63
00:03:48,16 --> 00:03:51,13
How's Ross doing since all the Emily stuff?
羅斯還好吧？ 還在為艾蜜莉傷心嗎？

64
00:03:51,39 --> 00:03:52,72
He's not great.
心情不太好

65
00:03:52,99 --> 00:03:56,02
But he's dealing with it. Wait,you're not
不過還死不了 等等，你該不會…
拜託，不可能

7
00:03:56,23 --> 00:03:59,63
I can't get started with all that Ross stuff again.
我不可能再跟羅斯交往

68
00:03:59,87 --> 00:04:02,34
He'll be screwed up for a long time.
他還要失魂落魄大半年哩

69
00:04:02,57 --> 00:04:06,30
Besides,I don't go for guys right after they get divorced.
況且你也知道 我不喜歡剛離婚的男人

70
00:04:06,57 --> 00:04:10,87
Right,you only go for them five minutes before they get married.
對，快結婚的人你才要

71
00:04:15,05 --> 00:04:16,88
-Two pounds of mocha java. -It's Danny.
我要兩磅爪哇摩卡咖啡 是丹尼

73
00:04:18,35 --> 00:04:19,51
Are you going to go out again?
你們還會出去嗎？

74
00:04:19,72 --> 00:04:22,55
I don't know. He hasn't called since we went out.
不知道 上次出去一次之後 他就沒再打給我

75
00:04:22,76 --> 00:04:25,85
I see him in the hallway. We flirt. I'm all:
我們只在走廊上打情罵俏 
我笑得花枝亂顫

77
00:04:27,00 --> 00:04:28,59
And then nothing.
卻沒下文

78
00:04:29,23 --> 00:04:29,99
嘿

79
00:04:31,33 --> 00:04:32,56
Wow,thirsty.
你很渴吧？

80
00:04:32,77 --> 00:04:36,23
I'm having a party on Saturday. Sort of a housewarming thing.
我週六要辦派對 慶祝我搬新家

82
00:04:36,77 --> 00:04:38,00
-Fun. -Great!
真有意思 真好

83
00:04:38,21 --> 00:04:39,67
I'm looking forward to it.
我也希望週六趕快到

84
00:04:39,94 --> 00:04:41,07
See you!
那我走了

86
00:04:46,18 --> 00:04:48,77
So I guess we won't be warming his house.
看來他新家不歡迎我們

87
00:04:51,59 --> 00:04:54,08
All right,I see what he's doing.
很好，我知道他在玩什麼把戲

88
00:04:54,36 --> 00:04:58,35
He's not asking me out because he wants me to ask him out.
他故意不約我 因為他要我主動約他

89
00:04:58,76 --> 00:04:59,75
And you won't do that.
可是你不鳥他

90
00:04:59,96 --> 00:05:01,36
That's right!
沒錯

91
00:05:01,60 --> 00:05:04,69
Because that would give him the control.
否則主導權就落在他手裡

92
00:05:04,93 --> 00:05:08,06
So now he comes up with this "I've got a party" thing...
他現在故意說什麼要辦派對 

93
00:05:08,27 --> 00:05:10,90
...to get me to hint for an invitation.
要我暗示他約我

94
00:05:11,14 --> 00:05:13,04
Blew up in his face,didn't it?
可是我當場給他好看

95
00:05:14,48 --> 00:05:16,31
So there is no party?
所以他根本沒有要辦派對

96
00:05:17,28 --> 00:05:20,21
No,there's a party. There's a party.
有，當然有

97
00:05:20,45 --> 00:05:21,92
But the power?
不過誰是老大

98
00:05:22,12 --> 00:05:24,28
That is still up for grabs.
還不知道哩

99
00:05:24,72 --> 00:05:26,48
You follow me?
你聽得懂嗎？

100
00:05:26,75 --> 00:05:28,02
I think so.
應該吧

101
00:05:28,22 --> 00:05:32,09
So he won't invite you to his party because he likes you?
你說他喜歡你 所以故意不約你

102
00:05:32,56 --> 00:05:33,55
Exactly!
就是這樣

103
00:05:36,40 --> 00:05:39,46
Then why didn't he invite me?
可是他為什麼不約我？

104
00:05:42,77 --> 00:05:44,57
To throw me off.
故意吊我胃口

105
00:05:53,81 --> 00:05:54,21
羅斯

106
00:05:55,02 --> 00:05:56,64
Hey,roomies!
親愛的室友

107
00:05:58,95 --> 00:06:00,94
I love what you've done with the place.
你把家裡佈置得真溫馨

108
00:06:01,16 --> 00:06:03,02
I know it's a lot of boxes.
我知道箱子堆得到處都是

109
00:06:03,26 --> 00:06:07,16
-I appreciate you letting me stay here. 
-Not a problem.
我要再次感謝你們收容我 沒問題

110
00:06:07,36 --> 00:06:09,49
Since you'll be here a while...
既然你要在這裡住一陣子

112
00:06:09,70 --> 00:06:12,67
...we could put your name on the answering machine.
乾脆錄一段你的留言

113
00:06:13,03 --> 00:06:14,83
I hope you don't mind...
是啊 希望你們別介意

114
00:06:15,04 --> 00:06:18,44
...but I kind of already jazzed it up a little.
我已經錄了一段

115
00:06:19,21 --> 00:06:20,50
Check it out.
你們聽

116
00:06:26,11 --> 00:06:27,21
We will
我們一定

117
00:06:27,48 --> 00:06:29,85
We will call you back
一定會回你電話

118
00:06:33,05 --> 00:06:34,52
Pretty cool.
很酷吧？

119
00:06:37,63 --> 00:06:40,96
-You're fake laughing too,right? -The tears are real.
你也是假笑吧？不過眼淚是真的

121
00:06:44,53 --> 00:06:46,73
You look beautiful this evening.
你今晚真漂亮

122
00:06:47,64 --> 00:06:49,03
Show me the badge again.
再給我看一次徽章

123
00:06:54,81 --> 00:06:56,21
Shiny.
真是閃閃發亮

124
00:06:56,91 --> 00:07:00,90
You mind if I wash up? Who knows where these have been?
我去洗個手
誰曉得這兩個寶貝碰過什麼

125
00:07:01,18 --> 00:07:03,24
You are just nonstop!
你真是寶到不行

127
00:07:14,16 --> 00:07:15,89
-We're out of here. -Why?
我們必須立刻走 為什麼？

128
00:07:16,10 --> 00:07:19,93
I saw 1 0 violations. I'm shutting this place down!
我剛經過廚房就看到十項違規
我要勒令他們停業

130
00:07:20,23 --> 00:07:23,50
-You have the power to do that? -This does.
你辦得到嗎？ 有這個就可以

132
00:07:25,01 --> 00:07:26,37
Shut it down.
那就讓他們停業吧

133
00:07:37,72 --> 00:07:38,88
嘿

134
00:07:41,12 --> 00:07:42,18
What are you doing?
你做什麼？

135
00:07:43,12 --> 00:07:44,39
Nothing.
沒什麼

136
00:07:46,09 --> 00:07:48,08
You built a fort,didn't you?
你造了一個城堡？

137
00:07:50,30 --> 00:07:51,70
Kind of.
差不多

138
00:07:51,93 --> 00:07:55,39
Oh,my God! The air purifier. Ross' air purifier.
天啊，是他的空氣清淨器

139
00:07:55,70 --> 00:07:58,97
All I heard for four years through college was....
我大學四年只聽得到…

140
00:08:01,11 --> 00:08:03,74
You should have gone out once in a while.
老兄，你不該只悶在宿舍裡

141
00:08:03,95 --> 00:08:06,44
-I hate this thing! -Come on,Chandler.
我討厭這東西 
錢德

142
00:08:06,75 --> 00:08:09,41
Ross is our friend. He needs us right now.
羅斯是我們的好友 他現在需要我們幫忙

144
00:08:09,62 --> 00:08:13,75
So why don't you be a grownup and come watch TV in the fort?
成熟點，進來城堡看電視吧

145
00:08:18,26 --> 00:08:21,39
Can't believe that Larry closed down Churman's. I love that place.
賴瑞竟然勒令楚門餐廳停業 
我很喜歡那家餐廳

146
00:08:21,56 --> 00:08:23,96
You should have heard about all their violations.
你應該聽聽他們有哪些違規

147
00:08:24,13 --> 00:08:28,16
Larry said that they should call it Vermin's.
賴瑞說他們該改名蟑螂餐廳

148
00:08:28,34 --> 00:08:30,36
That guy just plain kills me.
那傢伙實在太耍寶了

149
00:08:37,71 --> 00:08:40,01
I wanted to invite you to the party.
我來請你們參加明晚的派對

151
00:08:40,48 --> 00:08:42,54
Thanks,I'll try to stop by.
謝了，我們有時間就過去

152
00:08:42,85 --> 00:08:45,84
Actually,I think I'm going to be busy.
不過我可能有事

153
00:08:46,12 --> 00:08:47,11
You are?
是嗎？

154
00:08:49,19 --> 00:08:51,39
Remember,I've got that gala?
對，我上次跟你說要參加比賽

155
00:08:53,79 --> 00:08:55,63
What's the gala for?
什麼比賽？

156
00:08:56,70 --> 00:08:58,96
It's a regatta gala.
賽船會

157
00:08:59,87 --> 00:09:00,96
Do you sail?
你會開帆船？

158
00:09:01,34 --> 00:09:03,63
No,but I support it.
不會，可是我贊助比賽

159
00:09:05,47 --> 00:09:09,00
I hope I see you tomorrow night. Take care.
好吧，明晚見咯 保重，再見

162
00:09:12,81 --> 00:09:15,41
Walked right into that one, didn't he?
我這招打得他滿臉豆花

163
00:09:15,68 --> 00:09:16,98
What one?
哪一招？

164
00:09:17,22 --> 00:09:19,74
You wanted him to invite you and he did.
你希望他邀你參加派對 他也來啦

165
00:09:20,09 --> 00:09:23,15
He waited until the last minute. So if I said yes...
可是他等到最後一刻才來 如果我答應

166
00:09:23,36 --> 00:09:27,09
...he'd know I had nothing better to do than wait for his invitation.
他就知道 我沒事可做等著去他家

167
00:09:27,36 --> 00:09:28,69
But I said no...
但是我說不去 

168
00:09:28,90 --> 00:09:31,76
...which puts me back in the driver's seat.
所以還是我佔上風

169
00:09:32,00 --> 00:09:34,33
So the ball is in his court?
正點，所以換他出招咯？

170
00:09:34,57 --> 00:09:35,66
Ball?
出招？

171
00:09:35,87 --> 00:09:37,74
No,there's no ball.
他沒招可出了

172
00:09:39,24 --> 00:09:41,21
Hey,Phoebe,you want to join us?
菲比，你吃不吃？

173
00:09:41,38 --> 00:09:45,00
-Oh,sure,yeah. Where is this from? -It's from Sun Ling's.
好啊，哪裡買的？ 三林餐廳

175
00:09:45,18 --> 00:09:49,98
Oh,Larry just told me something about Sun Ling.
賴瑞跟我提過三林中菜

176
00:09:50,15 --> 00:09:52,45
Oh,no,thank you.
算了，多謝

177
00:10:03,16 --> 00:10:04,36
Joey,please.
喬伊，麻煩你

178
00:10:04,67 --> 00:10:05,79
Sorry.
對不起

179
00:10:22,98 --> 00:10:24,58
Hello,children.
小鬼們

180
00:10:25,35 --> 00:10:27,98
You want to play some foosball? Please?
要不要玩桌足球？求求你？

181
00:10:29,39 --> 00:10:30,95
好吧 不…

182
00:10:30,99 --> 00:10:34,83
We moved the table into my room because of all the boxes.
遊戲桌搬進我房間了
因為外面太多箱子

184
00:10:35,06 --> 00:10:36,43
Come on!
進來吧

185
00:10:42,37 --> 00:10:44,17
I have one question.
我有個問題

186
00:10:44,41 --> 00:10:47,07
What is the deal with this?
這是什麼碗糕？

187
00:10:48,18 --> 00:10:51,17
Bye-bye,little puppet Joey hand?
小布偶喬伊說再見？

188
00:10:51,91 --> 00:10:53,40
No,the quiet down thing.
不是，叫我閉嘴的手勢

189
00:10:54,62 --> 00:10:56,05
You mean this.
你是說這樣啊

190
00:10:59,25 --> 00:11:01,55
I don't know how much more I can take.
我不知道我還能憋多久

191
00:11:01,79 --> 00:11:05,89
Did you know he taped over my Baywatch tape with a show about bugs?
他竟然拿我的海灘遊俠錄影帶 去錄什麼怪小蟲

192
00:11:07,56 --> 00:11:08,96
My God!

193
00:11:09,43 --> 00:11:11,73
What if that had been porn?
要是裡面錄的是A片呢？

194
00:11:12,77 --> 00:11:14,67
All right,this may be tough...
別激動，或許你憋得很難過 

195
00:11:14,87 --> 00:11:17,43
...but it's Ross. I survived college with him.
可是他是老友羅斯
我跟他大學住四年都沒死了

196
00:11:18,04 --> 00:11:20,91
I guess I can hold out a little longer.
我或許還可以再忍一陣子

197
00:11:21,11 --> 00:11:22,74
Let's have a game.
來玩吧 好

198
00:11:25,05 --> 00:11:27,41
不要… 萬歲

199
00:11:29,65 --> 00:11:30,64
Fellas?
兩位

200
00:11:37,46 --> 00:11:38,98
So he's out of here.
他非走不可

201
00:11:47,50 --> 00:11:51,53
Got anything to eat? I went to Jono's and it was closed.
這裡有沒有東西可吃？
我剛去強諾買雞塊 那裡竟然停業了

203
00:11:51,77 --> 00:11:56,27
I took Larry there,but it was all violated,so we shut it down.
我帶賴瑞去，餐廳不合規定 我們勒令他們停業

204
00:11:57,18 --> 00:12:01,27
If this guy keeps closing our favorite places,where will we eat?
菲比，這傢伙不斷關掉 大家喜歡去的餐館 以後我們上哪吃飯？

206
00:12:01,52 --> 00:12:03,18
I don't know. Clean places?
不曉得，乾淨的地方？

207
00:12:03,42 --> 00:12:04,61
Yum!

208
00:12:10,69 --> 00:12:11,68
It's Danny.
是丹尼

209
00:12:11,96 --> 00:12:14,95
Don't let him in! I'm supposed to be at a gala.
別讓他進來，我現在 應該去看帆船賽了

210
00:12:15,20 --> 00:12:17,72
We'll be right there. Can't you say it's later?
我們馬上過去 不能說大賽還沒開始嗎？

212
00:12:18,57 --> 00:12:21,54
What kind of a regatta gala starts at night?
什麼？哪種帆船在晚上比賽？

213
00:12:22,10 --> 00:12:23,30
The fake kind.
假的那種

214
00:12:27,81 --> 00:12:31,14
-I need a ladle. You got a ladle? -We have a ladle.
嗨，我想借個勺子，你有嗎？

215
00:12:31,24 --> 00:12:31,54
我們有

216
00:12:33,75 --> 00:12:35,74
See you at the party.
謝了，待會兒見 好

217
00:12:37,32 --> 00:12:41,38
You know what Larry would say? He'd say,"See you ladle."
你們知道賴瑞會怎麼回答嗎？ 他會說，「杓後見」

219
00:12:45,86 --> 00:12:49,32
I'm done. You want anything? Sports? International?
我看完了，你要看嗎，羅斯？ 有體育、國際

220
00:12:49,56 --> 00:12:50,76
Apartment listings?
租屋版

221
00:12:51,57 --> 00:12:52,55
I'll take sports.
我要體育版 

222
00:12:52,77 --> 00:12:54,10
Mine!
我要

223
00:12:55,87 --> 00:12:57,39
All right,international.
那就國際版好了 

224
00:12:57,67 --> 00:12:58,70
That's mine too.
我也要

225
00:13:00,67 --> 00:13:02,27
I'm ltalian.
我是意大利裔

226
00:13:03,78 --> 00:13:08,34
I could check apartment listings, though there's never anything here.
不然看看租屋廣告吧 不過報上向來沒吉屋

227
00:13:08,58 --> 00:13:10,78
Not even on page seven?
第7頁也沒有嗎？

228
00:13:13,72 --> 00:13:16,49
You're right. Here's an affordable place.
有耶，你說得對 有個地方價錢很公道

229
00:13:16,69 --> 00:13:21,02
Two-bedroom,close to work. It's available in five weeks.
兩房、上班也近 可是還要五周才能搬進去

231
00:13:21,23 --> 00:13:23,20
What about that circled one?
圈起來那個呢？

232
00:13:24,60 --> 00:13:27,86
It's kind of expensive for a studio.
不知道耶，就套房來說有點貴

233
00:13:28,10 --> 00:13:29,80
But it's available now.
可是現在就能搬進去

234
00:13:30,04 --> 00:13:31,10
Isn't it?
對不對？

235
00:13:31,31 --> 00:13:32,80
Yes,it is.
的確是

236
00:13:33,11 --> 00:13:35,04
Let's go look at it!
我們去看看

237
00:13:36,88 --> 00:13:38,37
There we go!
好，我們走 走吧

238
00:13:40,55 --> 00:13:45,65
Guys,would you chip in for some new air filters for the purifier?
對了，忘了告訴你們
可不可以大家分攤買濾芯？

240
00:13:46,05 --> 00:13:48,99
I mean,after all, we are all using it.
畢竟空氣清淨器大家都有用到

241
00:13:49,26 --> 00:13:50,25
Let's go quicker!
快點走 好

242
00:14:04,51 --> 00:14:05,84
Oh,my God!
天啊

243
00:14:06,14 --> 00:14:09,63
Look at this kitchen/bathroom.
你們看這個廚房…兼浴室

244
00:14:10,61 --> 00:14:14,01
That's great! So you can cook while in the tub.
太棒了，可以一邊煮飯 一邊洗澡

245
00:14:14,25 --> 00:14:16,01
Somebody was using his head.
房東真是太聰明了

246
00:14:17,85 --> 00:14:20,45
Let's check out the rest of the place.
再看看其他地方

247
00:14:29,43 --> 00:14:31,49
I think this is it.
就這麼大了

248
00:14:32,67 --> 00:14:35,46
I don't know. Maybe we should keep looking.
我們應該看看別間公寓

249
00:14:35,77 --> 00:14:38,17
But this place is available now.
可是這地方馬上就能搬進來

250
00:14:38,47 --> 00:14:41,50
You don't want to be stuck with us for five weeks.
對啊，你不會願意 繼續跟我們住五周

252
00:14:47,78 --> 00:14:50,55
So you think I should take this place?
你覺得我應該租下？

253
00:14:50,82 --> 00:14:52,45
It's perfect!
這裡很棒啊

254
00:14:56,46 --> 00:14:58,02
How about you?
你呢？

255
00:14:58,29 --> 00:15:00,69
Kitchen,slash,bathroom.
這裡有廚房兼浴室耶

256
00:15:03,86 --> 00:15:06,46
I see what you guys are saying.
好吧，我懂了

257
00:15:06,70 --> 00:15:09,53
I'll go downstairs and fill out an application.
我下樓填申請表

258
00:15:14,04 --> 00:15:16,13
We are bad people.
我們是壞人

259
00:15:17,01 --> 00:15:19,71
He knew we were trying to get rid of him.
他知道我們想趕他走

261
00:15:22,85 --> 00:15:25,51
Could we get a bathtub in our kitchen?
我們廚房能不能裝浴缸？

262
00:15:29,92 --> 00:15:31,22
Ready for dinner?
要去吃飯了嗎？

263
00:15:31,49 --> 00:15:33,43
-Absolutely. -Great.
好啊

264
00:15:33,69 --> 00:15:35,86
You wanted to go to the ltalian place on Bleecker St.?
你上次不是說要去布裡克街 那家意大利餐廳？

265
00:15:36,06 --> 00:15:37,83
I love that place!
我愛死那裡了

266
00:15:38,07 --> 00:15:39,53
So,no.
所以…不行

267
00:15:41,04 --> 00:15:43,23
How about Mama Lozetti's?
「李賽提老媽」呢？

268
00:15:43,74 --> 00:15:44,90
Sure.
沒問題

269
00:15:46,04 --> 00:15:48,91
How long has that milk been sitting out?
不知道那瓶牛奶放多久了？

270
00:15:49,44 --> 00:15:51,74
No,this place is totally healthy.
這地方非常乾淨

271
00:15:52,01 --> 00:15:54,50
This milk is mine. I bought this today...
那瓶牛奶是我的 今天買的

272
00:15:54,72 --> 00:15:57,62
...because I was thirsty for milk, you know?
我突然想喝牛奶

273
00:16:01,89 --> 00:16:03,52
Okay,let's go.
我們走吧

274
00:16:06,59 --> 00:16:07,86
Hey,buddy.
老兄

275
00:16:08,13 --> 00:16:13,19
Health Code 1 1 B requires that refuse be taken out the back exit.
你知道衛生規則 11條B款嗎？ 垃圾應該從後門拿出去

277
00:16:13,40 --> 00:16:15,70
But then I have to go all the way around.
可是這樣就得從乾洗店繞路

278
00:16:15,94 --> 00:16:18,87
So you choose convenience over health?
你寧可方便也不顧衛生？

279
00:16:19,61 --> 00:16:24,13
Would you be interested in a free coffee?
請你喝咖啡好嗎？

280
00:16:24,31 --> 00:16:25,94
Stop,Larry.
賴瑞，別這樣

281
00:16:27,31 --> 00:16:32,31
Can't you just be Larry and not Larry the health inspector guy?
你能不能別老想著工作？

282
00:16:32,62 --> 00:16:34,45
It was exciting at first.
一開始還很刺激

283
00:16:34,72 --> 00:16:39,09
But now,it's like,so where are we going to eat ever?
現在簡直哪家餐廳也去不了

284
00:16:40,09 --> 00:16:43,00
I suppose I could give him a warning.
不然我口頭警告他好了

285
00:16:43,23 --> 00:16:44,49
Thank you.
謝謝

286
00:16:45,50 --> 00:16:46,49
Go,go!
快走啊

287
00:16:50,84 --> 00:16:54,33
If,after dinner, you still need to bust someone...
要是吃飽飯後你還想抓人

288
00:16:54,58 --> 00:16:57,84
...I know a hot dog vendor who picks his nose.
我知道哪個熱狗攤老闆 喜歡挖鼻子

289
00:17:01,82 --> 00:17:05,51
Maybe we did good, helping Ross get back on his feet.
搞不好我們做的是好事 幫助羅斯早點恢復正常

290
00:17:05,82 --> 00:17:07,45
That was a nice place.
況且那地方實在不錯 是啊

291
00:17:07,69 --> 00:17:12,68
No closet space,but he could hang his stuff out the window in a bag.
雖然櫃子不多 不過可以用袋子裝好掛在窗外

292
00:17:12,79 --> 00:17:13,02
是啊

293
00:17:17,10 --> 00:17:18,09
What do we do?
現在該怎麼辦？

294
00:17:18,60 --> 00:17:20,12
I don't know.
不知道

295
00:17:20,37 --> 00:17:21,99
Maybe pizza?
要吃披薩嗎？

296
00:17:23,37 --> 00:17:25,17
About Ross!
我說的是羅斯

297
00:17:31,11 --> 00:17:32,84
喂

298
00:17:34,45 --> 00:17:38,15
It's the apartment manager. Ross put us as references.
我是，是公寓經理 羅斯填我們當介紹人

299
00:17:38,39 --> 00:17:41,55
Ross is the greatest guy. He's very reliable
羅斯絕對是好人 這人非常可靠

300
00:17:41,82 --> 00:17:46,19
Of course,he has a big,huge dog that barks into the night.
不過他養了一支大狗 那支狗半夜叫個不停

302
00:17:48,16 --> 00:17:50,46
Well,who doesn't love dogs?
誰不喜歡狗？

303
00:17:51,33 --> 00:17:53,32
He's a tap dancer.
他是個踢踏舞者

304
00:17:54,84 --> 00:17:57,50
Yes,some would say that is a lost art.
這的確是失傳的藝術

305
00:17:58,37 --> 00:18:00,40
He's a pimp!
他是皮條客

306
00:18:01,54 --> 00:18:03,57
There you go. He's a pimp.
沒錯，就是皮條客

307
00:18:03,84 --> 00:18:05,87
He's a big,tap-dancing pimp!
他是會跳踢踏舞的皮條客

308
00:18:07,65 --> 00:18:08,84
喂

309
00:18:26,53 --> 00:18:28,80
-Okay,honey,I'm ready. -What are you doing?
我準備好了 你穿這樣幹麼？

310
00:18:28,97 --> 00:18:32,50
I am going to wander into the party and I will be all,you know:
我要晃進派對 裝做一副 

313
00:18:32,67 --> 00:18:36,30
"l don't need this, I'm coming from a regatta gala."
剛從帆船賽回來的樣子

314
00:18:38,95 --> 00:18:41,31
Did you get this out of a book?
你這是從書上學來的嗎？

315
00:18:41,48 --> 00:18:45,75
Monica,honey,this is as real as it gets.
親愛的摩妮卡，書如人生啊

316
00:18:56,36 --> 00:18:59,13
This is never going to work. He's right there.
該死，這可不行 他就站在那裡

317
00:18:59,37 --> 00:19:00,42
Just go say hi.
去打聲招呼就行啦

318
00:19:00,70 --> 00:19:05,66
I have to go downstairs and back up, as if I'm coming home from the gala.
不行，我得從樓下走上來 假裝我剛從外面回來

319
00:19:06,44 --> 00:19:10,00
So just go distract him. But don't be sexy.
你去引開他的注意力 但是別勾引他

320
00:19:11,35 --> 00:19:12,37
丹尼

321
00:19:13,05 --> 00:19:14,14
What's going on?
你好

322
00:19:14,35 --> 00:19:17,32
This is a great party. Great food.
這個派對真不錯，食物也很好

323
00:19:19,02 --> 00:19:23,98
You know,most parties,it's all chips and salsa,chips and salsa.
大部分派對都只有薯片、辣醬 薯片、辣醬

324
00:19:24,46 --> 00:19:25,69
So....

325
00:19:27,86 --> 00:19:28,85
What's this?
這是什麼？

326
00:19:29,70 --> 00:19:30,69
Salad.
沙拉

327
00:19:31,60 --> 00:19:31,86
喔

328
00:19:33,63 --> 00:19:34,86
And what's this?
這又是什麼？

329
00:19:36,17 --> 00:19:37,50
Bread.
麵包

330
00:19:38,41 --> 00:19:39,67
Aren't you a chef?
你不是廚師嗎？

331
00:19:42,31 --> 00:19:43,74
嘿，瑞秋

332
00:19:45,05 --> 00:19:47,57
Right,tonight was your party.
對了，你今晚要辦派對

333
00:19:47,81 --> 00:19:49,91
You look great! I'm glad you made it.
你穿得真漂亮 幸好你趕回來了

334
00:19:50,22 --> 00:19:53,58
Well,you know, the gala had to end sometime.
比賽總不能沒完沒了

335
00:19:53,75 --> 00:19:57,32
Don't go anywhere. I'll be right back.
你別走開，我馬上回來

336
00:19:57,42 --> 00:19:57,62
沒問題

337
00:19:59,63 --> 00:20:02,09
Whose court is the ball in now?
你說現在換誰出招啦？

338
00:20:02,70 --> 00:20:05,46
I thought there wasn't a ball.
你不是說他沒招可出？

339
00:20:06,30 --> 00:20:10,70
Come on. He's glad I came. He doesn't want me to go anywhere.
拜託，他很高興我來了 而且還叫我別走開

340
00:20:11,00 --> 00:20:13,60
Ball's flying all over the place.
我們兩個現在是你來我往

341
00:20:14,68 --> 00:20:16,04
This is my friend,Tom.
瑞秋，這是我朋友湯姆

342
00:20:16,31 --> 00:20:18,94
This is the girl I told you about.
這就是我跟你提過的小姐

343
00:20:19,15 --> 00:20:22,14
Come on! You telling people about me?
拜託，你跟人提過我？

344
00:20:22,55 --> 00:20:25,28
I think you two could really hit it off.
你們一定會來電

345
00:20:25,85 --> 00:20:27,62
I'm gonna go mingle.
我去跟朋友哈拉了

346
00:20:29,22 --> 00:20:33,63
So you work at Bloomingdale's? My mom calls it "Bloomies."
你在布魯明代爾百貨上班？ 
我媽都說那裡是「布明兒」

348
00:20:40,90 --> 00:20:42,46
At ease,soldier!
真不錯，稍息，大兵

349
00:20:44,20 --> 00:20:45,19
I'm sorry?
什麼？

350
00:20:45,41 --> 00:20:48,84
You can just drop the act. I know what's going on.
沒關係，湯姆，你別裝了 我知道你們搞什麼鬼

351
00:20:49,04 --> 00:20:51,03
You're Danny's wingman,right?
你是丹尼的好友對不對？

352
00:20:51,31 --> 00:20:54,68
You guys are best buds,frat bros.
你們交情老、感情好

353
00:20:56,22 --> 00:20:58,88
I'm going to go talk to a friend.
我要去…找朋友

354
00:20:59,19 --> 00:21:01,98
Yeah,you go talk to your friend.
請便，去找你朋友吧

355
00:21:02,22 --> 00:21:04,21
Go tell him,"Nice try."
告訴他，「這招漂亮」

356
00:21:08,23 --> 00:21:10,32
He just keeps lobbing them up...
他真是出招連連 

357
00:21:10,53 --> 00:21:13,90
...and I keep knocking them right out of the park.
不過我可是招招都破

358
00:21:16,20 --> 00:21:18,23
I think I need a drink.
我想喝杯飲料 我也要

359
00:21:22,84 --> 00:21:24,50
Ninety-eight...
98、

360
00:21:24,71 --> 00:21:26,18
...ninety-nine...
99、

361
00:21:26,41 --> 00:21:28,28
...one hundred!
100

362
00:21:28,52 --> 00:21:29,68
Okay. Go.
走吧

363
00:21:29,92 --> 00:21:32,01
Dude,I'm telling you,I'm fine.
告訴你，我沒問題

364
00:21:35,96 --> 00:21:37,75
Here we go,here we go.
我扶住你了

365
00:21:38,69 --> 00:21:40,35
嘿 嘿

366
00:21:40,96 --> 00:21:45,59
So I didn't get that apartment. Some problem with my application.
我沒租到那間公寓 我的申請作業出狀況

368
00:21:45,80 --> 00:21:47,06
You're kidding?
哪有可能？ 不會吧

369
00:21:47,27 --> 00:21:51,43
But Phoebe said I could stay at her place for a while,so....
不過菲比答應讓我搬去跟她住

370
00:21:51,64 --> 00:21:55,04
Well,you can't stay with Phoebe. We're roomies.
你不能住菲比家 我們可是室友耶

371
00:21:55,28 --> 00:21:58,11
You don't need me taking up all your space.
我不能再佔用你們公寓

372
00:21:58,38 --> 00:22:02,78
We got plenty of space. There's still some by that speaker.
反正這裡大得很 音箱旁邊還有空地

374
00:22:05,15 --> 00:22:06,81
Please,just stay.
住下來吧 對

375
00:22:07,22 --> 00:22:08,28
Are you sure?
你們確定？ 當然

376
00:22:08,56 --> 00:22:11,62
-Definitely. -You have to stay.
羅斯，你非住下來不可

377
00:22:13,43 --> 00:22:15,83
好吧 就這麼辦

378
00:22:17,30 --> 00:22:19,13
So I'm a pimp,huh?
你們說我是皮條客？

379
00:22:21,80 --> 00:22:23,63
It's okay.
算了

380
00:22:23,90 --> 00:22:26,17
Sometimes I can be a pain in the ass.
我知道我有時候很顧人怨 

381
00:22:26,41 --> 00:22:30,00
But just talk to me. Tell me if something bothers you.
不過你們可以直說 明白告訴我哪裡做得不好

383
00:22:30,28 --> 00:22:35,41
And I'll do everything I can to keep my annoying habits just....
我可以盡量改掉惹人嫌的習慣

384
00:22:51,50 --> 00:22:54,37
Well,I see you've had a very productive day.
顯然你今天過得很充實

385
00:22:55,07 --> 00:22:57,00
The cowboy hat's a little much.
不過戴牛仔帽也太扯了吧？

386
00:22:57,27 --> 00:22:59,17
Come on,it's fun!
進來一起玩

387
00:23:02,28 --> 00:23:03,26
All right.
好吧

388
00:23:10,92 --> 00:23:12,38
Isn't this a woman's hat?
這不是女人的帽子嗎？

389
00:23:13,39 --> 00:23:15,29
Stop talking crazy,and make us tea!
還不趕快閉嘴去泡茶？

390
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


391
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00

